          "heading": "前提・制限",
          "availability": "present",
          "priority": "detail",
          "items": [
            { "text": "ユーザーに見えるのは、発行元の種類が許可され、コネクタが有効で、User access と Staged rollout に含まれ、Copilot ライセンスがある場合のみ", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/copilot/connectors/federated-connectors-overview", "locator": "Which setting controls what", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-07T08:10:00Z" }] },
            { "text": "Staged rollout は User access で許可されたユーザーの範囲を超えられない", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/copilot/connectors/federated-connectors-overview", "locator": "Admin experience and controls", "retrievedAt": "2026-11-07T08:10:00Z" }] }
